Package: contentiousR
Type: Package
Title: Tools and Data for Contentious Politics and Civil Conflict Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ruslan", "Guseinov", email = "rigusseinov@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-1156-9495"))
Description: Constructs country-year panels for contentious politics and civil conflicts research. Functions create state panels using Correlates of
    War or Gleditsch-Ward identifiers and join curated socioeconomic,
    leadership, democracy, conflict, protest, and revolutionary-episode data.
    Included sources comprise Gapminder, NAVCO 2.1
    <doi:10.7910/DVN/MHOXDV>, the Social Conflict Analysis Database
    <doi:10.1080/03050629.2012.697426>, and the UCDP/PRIO Armed Conflict Dataset
    <doi:10.1177/0022343302039005007>, and Major Episodes of Contention
    <doi:10.1093/jopres/xjaf008>. V-Dem indicators require the optional
    'vdemdata' package, which is not on CRAN and can be installed from
    <https://github.com/vdeminstitute/vdemdata>.
